    "availabilityStatus": "The analysis was carried out at the request of the maternity care organization (MCO) for the purpose of quality monitoring and potential improvement of the organization (education, recognition of risk groups, response to major complications). The medical-ethhical review board (MERB) granted exempt from informed consent for the analysis of ERKEN-complications using a fully anonimyzed dataset from care as usual (MERB protocol nr: 16/119). Access to the datafiles is therefore restricted. Interested researchers are encouraged to request access to the datafiles by contacting the maternity care organization whose data was analyzed (info@kraamzorg.org).",
